  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n{(0.51)3 + (0.49)3} ÷ {(0.51)2 - 0.2499 + (0.49)2}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² + b² - ab)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n{(0.51)3 + (0.49)3} ÷ {(0.51)2 - 0.2499 + (0.49)2}\n\n⇒ {(0.51)3 + (0.49)3} ÷ {(0.51)2 - 0.51 × 0.49 + (0.49)2}\n\n⇒ {(0.51) + (0.49)(0.512 - 0.51 × 0.49 + 0.492)} ÷ {(0.51)2 - 0.51 × 0.49 + (0.49)2}\n\n⇒ 0.51 + 0.49\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**∴ The required answer is 1.**",
